// The query traverses two associations in one navigation —
// Sale.seller.department.name — so the generated SQL chains the Emp_Sale join
// (SALES.SALE -> HR.EMPLOYEE) into the Emp_Dept join (HR.EMPLOYEE -> HR.DEPARTMENT),
// a nested (chained) join. Emp_Sale also crosses the SALES/HR schema boundary.